sequenceDiagram
    participant Editor as 编辑器
    participant Adapter as ACP 服务端适配器
    participant Runtime as 应用运行时
    Editor->>Adapter: session/new
    Adapter-->>Editor: 返回 sessionId
    Editor->>Adapter: session/prompt 加上 sessionId
    Adapter->>Runtime: stream 使用 sessionId 作为 thread_id
    Runtime-->>Adapter: 累计正文 读到 3 条
    Adapter-->>Editor: session/update 读到 3 条
    Runtime-->>Adapter: 累计正文 读到 3 条，2 条需要复核
    Adapter-->>Editor: session/update 只补发后半句
    Adapter-->>Editor: stopReason 为 end_turn
